  "headline": "Polri Holds Ethics Hearing For Brigjen Tedjo In Treason Probe",
  "seoTitle": "Brigjen Tedjo Kusumo Treason Investigation",
  "metaDescription": "Brigjen Tedjo Kusumo faces an ethics hearing as Bareskrim Polri investigates treason allegations involving illegal surveillance of state officials.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Brigjen Tedjo Kusumo is currently under investigation for alleged treason involving illegal surveillance of state officials and police candidates.",
    "Bareskrim Polri has initiated an ethics hearing for the brigadier general while continuing to process evidence including banners and documents.",
    "Authorities have identified six suspects in the case and uncovered multiple locations used as operational posts in the Jakarta, Bogor, and Tangerang areas."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police (Polri) has launched an ethics investigation into Brigjen Tedjo Kusumo following his designation as a suspect in a treason case against President Prabowo Subianto. Investigators from Bareskrim Polri allege that the officer conducted illegal surveillance on government officials and individuals being considered for the position of National Police Chief. Evidence collected during raids across Jakarta, Bogor, and Tangerang include various documents, banners, and items labeled with slogans such as 'IdonesiaSadar' and 'One Peace.' Authorities are currently treating this surveillance activity as a component of the broader criminal treason allegations. Six individuals have been named as suspects as the police proceed with both internal disciplinary proceedings through the Divpropam and criminal investigations into the conspiracy to undermine state institutions.",
